WEBVTT

1
00:00:05,950 --> 00:00:07,830
Otherwise, I am a grown man wearing a female watch.

2
00:00:07,830 --> 00:00:09,510
I bought it for you to take with you

3
00:00:09,510 --> 00:00:11,870
You suffered when you followed me before

4
00:00:11,870 --> 00:00:18,770
From now on, if someone else’s daughter-in-law has it, you must also have Changsheng. This is

5
00:00:18,770 --> 00:00:20,850
Your cousin will go to town to see his wife tomorrow

6
00:00:20,850 --> 00:00:22,330
Missing something decent

7
00:00:22,330 --> 00:00:25,090
I borrowed this car from my second aunt for two days.

8
00:00:25,090 --> 00:00:26,490
Just two days

9
00:00:26,490 --> 00:00:28,770
How can a family divide yours and mine?

10
00:00:28,770 --> 00:00:31,140
Heavy snowfall last month

11
00:00:31,140 --> 00:00:33,100
My family was without food for three days

12
00:00:33,100 --> 00:00:35,460
Su Yu went to your house to borrow half a bowl of pound noodles.

13
00:00:35,460 --> 00:00:36,820
You let the dog out and you have her

14
00:00:37,020 --> 00:00:39,970
That was all in the past

15
00:00:41,070 --> 00:00:42,670
Now I remember we are a family
